rule node_1 with provenance main at art-z1_abs-z_inhalt-n1_text-n1_marker-n1:
Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe holds for a case if
    the answer to Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe for the case is a truth value
    and Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe would hold for the case.

